#: karm_part.cpp:246 mainwindow.cpp:379
msgid ""
"This will start timing for the selected task.\n"
"It is even possible to time several tasks simultaneously.\n"
"\n"
"You may also start timing of a tasks by double clicking the left mouse "
"button on a given task. This will, however, stop timing of other tasks."
msgstr ""
"यसले चयन गरेका कार्यका लागि टाइमिङ सुरु गर्नेछ।\n"
"तापनि एकैसाथ धेरै कार्यमा समय दिन सम्भव छ ।\n"
"\n"
"तपाईँले दिएका कार्यमा माउसको बायाँ बटन डबल क्लिक गरेर कार्यको टाइमिङ सुरु गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ । तापनि, यसले, अन्य कार्यको टाइमिङ रोक्नेछ ।"

#: karm_part.cpp:255 karm_part.cpp:256 mainwindow.cpp:388 mainwindow.cpp:389
